{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in New York","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in New York</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q131578574","titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_New_York","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in New York","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in New York</span></span>"},"pageid":78594668,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Seal_of_New_York_%28state%29.svg/330px-Seal_of_New_York_%28state%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":330},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Seal_of_New_York_%28state%29.svg/500px-Seal_of_New_York_%28state%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":379,"height":379},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378046040","tid":"f67435f4-be83-11f1-92b1-4835c984842b","timestamp":"2026-10-02T17:09:01Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_New_York","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_New_York?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_New_York?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_New_York"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_New_York","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_New_York","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_New_York?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_New_York"}},"extract":"An election will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the 26 U.S. representatives from the state of New York, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary election took place on June 23, 2026. As the state of New York has closed primary elections, only registered party members are allowed to vote in each party's primary.","extract_html":"<p>An election will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the 26 U.S. representatives from the state of New York, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary election took place on June 23, 2026. As the state of New York has closed primary elections, only registered party members are allowed to vote in each party's primary.</p>"}